@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam arrowThickness 1.1
skinparam arrowColor LOGIC_COLOR_T4
skinparam classBackgroundColor LOGIC_COLOR

Class ArchiveCommandParser
Class ContextArgumentParser

Class "{abstract}\nCommand" as Command
Class SetArchivedByIndexCommand
Class ArchiveCommand
Class UnarchiveCommand
Class SetArchivedByContextCommand

Class Model MODEL_COLOR
Class Context MODEL_COLOR

Command <|-down- SetArchivedByIndexCommand
Command <|-down- SetArchivedByContextCommand
SetArchivedByIndexCommand <|-down- ArchiveCommand
SetArchivedByIndexCommand <|-down- UnarchiveCommand

SetArchivedByContextCommand -right->"1" Context
SetArchivedByContextCommand .right.> Model : <<call>>
SetArchivedByIndexCommand .right.> Model : <<call>>

ArchiveCommandParser .up.> ArchiveCommand
ArchiveCommandParser .up.> UnarchiveCommand
ArchiveCommandParser .up.> SetArchivedByContextCommand
ArchiveCommandParser .right.> ContextArgumentParser

note bottom of ContextArgumentParser
  The parser <<create>>s the commands
  and calls ContextArgumentParser
  (dotted arrows are dependencies)
end note
@enduml
